Z||000009||Elvira||08-24-2001||08:54 AM||||Yes you can register there.  Steve Kelley got the Fiero class added last year and we had 7 cars there I believe.  Not too bad considering we just announced it like two days before the actual show!  It is an awesome show with ALOT of beautiful cars (over 600 registered so far).  Chester and I will be there again this year.  Everyone come and join us!<P>          Rob & Renee<BR>          Co-Events Directors, NEFA||||reg||10
